      "content": "yeah i'll check for webbing. but it's just so strange... i've got the greenhouse locked up and everything seems sterile, yet these holes just keep popping up in these specific little groups while i'm not looking. it feels almost intentional, like something is sneaking in and out in the middle of the night. is there anything else that can cause damage that wouldn't leave a trace or be easily seen during the day?",
